.SH NAME
perturbation_channel_gain \- Get or set the injection gain of the perturbation channel.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIperturbation_channel_gain(\fBgps\fR as <generic> GPSModel, 
\fBgain\fR as double = -1, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get or set the injection gain of the perturbation channel.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgps\fB \fR\- the trained model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgain\fB \fR\- 
 the non negative gain; a negative value (the default) only reads the current value.
 \fB0\fR is equivalent to disabling the channel.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the currently effective gain.
.PP
